        &lt;/ul&gt;

    &lt;/li&gt;

&lt;/ol&gt;</code></pre>

<div class="try-it-container">
    <button type="button"
            class="try-it-btn"
            onclick="tryHTML(this)">
        Try It
    </button>
</div>


            <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mt-5">5. Ordered List Inside Unordered List</h2>

            <p>
